From the floating ribs down to the hip pivot (髀樞), it is six cun long. (The thigh is called the thigh (股); above the thigh is called the hip bone (髀楗). Below the bone, above the thigh, where the two bones join, is called the hip pivot, which is the place of the foot Shaoyang Huantiao (環跳) point.)
From the hip pivot down to the middle of the knee, it is one chi and nine cun long.
